OL,3,GNEWSAStories from across Yorkshire to
OL,4,Amake you smile
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvery week in Yorkshire we cover
OL,7,Fuplifting and feel-good stories about
OL,8,Fpeople, places and animals across our
OL,9,Fregion - and we like to shout about
OL,10,Fthem.
OL,12,FThis week, we feature a young girl's
OL,13,Fdream of working the Asda checkout, a
OL,14,F480-mile charity cycle ride, and the
OL,15,Flegacy Dolly Parton left right here in
OL,16,Fthe region.
OL,18,FA 12-year-old girl has been given the
OL,19,Fchance to "work" at her favourite
OL,20,Fsupermarket as a birthday treat.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
