OL,3,GNEWSAStories from across Yorkshire to
OL,4,Amake you smile
OL,5,
OL,6,FHope, who is non verbal and has a
OL,7,Fneurological condition, loves shopping
OL,8,Fat Asda in Chaucer Road, Sheffield, so
OL,9,Fthe store arranged for her to don a
OL,10,Funiform and have a go on the checkouts.
